    w("- C4's g* uses the same S1 / 'moderate' drift and 5-sigma spread as 1B; the Gaussian 5-sigma estimate is optimistic at small g (1B).")
    w("")
    w("## 13. Which findings are paper results")
    w("")
    w("| finding | verdict |")
    w("|---|---|")
    w("| Differential 2T2R: supply current is nearly data-independent, droop depends on the active-row count and is absorbed by the table | **Survives**, with the rail requirement it implies; a clean negative result against the single-ended intuition. |")
    w("| Row line of a 64-bitline macro needs drivers at both ends; per-column gain is not a constant but low-rank in (column, group) | **Survives** (validated mesh); the rank-3 residual is near the sampling floor. |")
    w("| Idle floating bitlines disturb the shared row line (the narrow sensing mode is worse than the wide one) | **Survives as a design finding** - transient-simulated; sensitive to the cell/bitline C assumption. |")
    w("| Centre tap pays only at small sigma, and less than a lumped model says | **Survives** (mesh-measured at the true positions). |")
