    w("- **sigma_lnG** [ASSUM, swept]: still sets g (1B); needs measured device data (1D).")
    w("- **Drift exponent / spread** [ASSUM, swept] (1B).")
    w("- **Bitline / row-line resistance per pitch (0.5-0.72 ohm), driver resistance** [ASSUM]; the 1C requirement is stated against them. **Rail resistance and the metal that realises it** (0.0072 ohm/pitch needs a 0.56 um strap at an assumed 0.02 ohm/sq) [ASSUM].")
    w("- **Bitline, row-line and coupling capacitance** (0.2 fF/pitch total, cc 0.25-0.75) [ASSUM]; **sense-node capacitance** 5 fF [ASSUM].")
    w("- **The sense stage**: input-referred current noise (1 uA, 1 sigma [ASSUM]), integration time, energy per read, the 8-comparator flash assumed in the area; **the pulse length T and the decoupling it needs** (the DC results use ideal pads; the dynamic study assumes R_pad, L_pad).")
    w("- **Layout densities** behind the area (driver um^2 per um of width, comparator/sense/DAC areas, SRAM um^2/bit, decap density) [ASSUM, low/mid/high].")
